{"asset_key":"ep7/herohub_story_17411180","episode":"ep7","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"17411180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1741118001:1":{"text":"呼……这阳光，这微风，这才叫生活嘛。","source_cn":"呼……这阳光，这微风，这才叫生活嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2C45976A1CB36B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1741118002:1":{"text":"可惜又是圣古堂消失，又是公主不见的……连空气里都是恐慌的味道。","source_cn":"可惜又是圣古堂消失，又是公主不见的……连空气里都是恐慌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB52CAB7A369631A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1741118003:1":{"text":"原则上，身为赛凡纳的传奇狐狸，我也得为维护赛凡纳的安宁做点什么的。","source_cn":"原则上，身为赛凡纳的传奇狐狸，我也得为维护赛凡纳的安宁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD00B18E78CF51493","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1741118004:1":{"text":"可是好不容易才把身子晒得暖烘烘的，真不想动弹啊……","source_cn":"可是好不容易才把身子晒得暖烘烘的，真不想动弹啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05A4B8F212BBBC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小狐狸":{"text":"小狐狸","source":"小狐狸","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}